1
00:00:10,344 --> 00:00:11,887
Hyesung drank too much

2
00:00:13,222 --> 00:00:14,681
I didn't even know
his address

3
00:00:15,891 --> 00:00:19,186
By the way, you two
look quite close

4
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:22,105
You came all the way
here to pick him up

5
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:24,816
We've been friends
since childhood

6
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:27,944
But…

7
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:30,822
Why are you trembling
so much?

8
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:37,621
I think I have a cold

9
00:00:37,746 --> 00:00:39,081
It's a bit cold

10
00:00:39,206 --> 00:00:41,166
I'll call a chauffeur
for you then

11
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:42,918
No, I'm fine

12
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:44,503
I better walk home
to sober up

13
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:48,047
I'm leaving now

14
00:00:48,882 --> 00:00:50,384
Please take care
of Hyesung

15
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:52,551
Thank you

16
00:01:02,271 --> 00:01:03,480
Are you awake?

17
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:04,605
Go wash up then

18
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:07,776
This is
Shin Yoo-il's place

19
00:01:07,901 --> 00:01:09,736
Shindecent…

20
00:01:17,577 --> 00:01:19,162
No, it's not

21
00:01:24,418 --> 00:01:26,003
Just go back to sleep
